# Vendored prebuilt studio (minified dist/ + Python servers) is DELIBERATELY
# COMMITTED: this CLI repo publishes to PyPI on its own and has no access to the
# studio source, so the wheel must ship the prebuilt bundle. These negations
# override the generic `dist/` ignore above (re-include dirs first, then files).
# Refresh before a release:  python remoroo_studio/scripts/bundle_studio.py
!remoroo/_studio/
!remoroo/_studio/**/
!remoroo/_studio/**
